"en": "Hidden In New York there is a clandestine community known as Fabletown\nfilled with fairy tale characters. The Fables who live there arrived hundreds of years ago \nwhen their Homelands were attacked. Forced into exile, they protect themselves\nfrom the mundane world with a magic called Glamor."
},
