"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Why did you run?"
},
{
"k": "1245",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "[heavy breathing] Why... [coughs] did you run?"
},
{
"k": "1246",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "[out of breath] What?"
},
{
"k": "1247",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Fuck man, because you chased after me. The fuck was I supposed to do?"
},
{
"k": "1248",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "A fuckin' guy blew his face off in front of me. The fuck would you do?"
},
{
"k": "1249",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "[out of breath] The same thing should be doing. Investigating. Looking for clues. The fuck you doing hiding in closets?"
},
{
"k": "1250",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "What were you doing back there?"
},
{
"k": "1251",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Who are you?"
},
{
"k": "1252",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "[heavy breathing] Who are you?"
},
{
"k": "1253",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Listen, man. I'm a... private investigator."
},
{
"k": "1254",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "I'm a... private investigator. Just looking for the same answers you are."
},
{
"k": "1255",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "You're lookin' for The Woodsman, right?"
},
{
"k": "1256",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Who's your boss?"
},
{
"k": "1257",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Oh, don't worry. It still is."
},
{
"k": "1258",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "I can't tell you that. It's confidential. Sorry. I'm sure you understand."
},
{
"k": "1259",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Who's your \"employer\"?"
},
{
"k": "1260",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "This could've been easy."
},
{
"k": "1261",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Checking out the guy was married to the girl. Seemed a good place to start. Tracking down... leads."
},
{
"k": "1262",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "What kind of leads?"
},
{
"k": "1263",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Nope. Can't say that I do. Come on. You're coming with me."
},
{
"k": "1264",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Who are you exactly?"
},
{
"k": "1265",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Who hired you?"
},
{
"k": "1266",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "This is for a sandwich shop."
},
{
"k": "1267",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Really? Huh. Must've run out."
},
{
"k": "1268",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "I'm Dee, and I'm a private investigator. There's a business card in my shirt pocket. You can see for yourself."
},
{
"k": "1269",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Who are you really?"
},
{
"k": "1270",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "[hit him]"
},
{
"k": "1271",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Ow!"
},
{
"k": "1272",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "The fuck?!"
},
{
"k": "1273",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "[happy] Dum."
},
{
"k": "1274",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "He's Dum."
},
{
"k": "1275",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "No. I'm Dee..."
},
{
"k": "1276",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Dumb? Yeah, it is. Look, it'd be much easier for you to--"
