"k": "1286",
"who": "WACHOWSKI",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "We both know license plates are hard to remember."
},
{
"k": "1287",
"who": "WACHOWSKI",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "That fat guy that hit you with the thing or the other fat guy that you were talkin' to?"
},
{
"k": "1288",
"who": "WACHOWSKI",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "[beat]Sorry I hit you with my car."
},
{
"k": "1289",
"who": "WACHOWSKI",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Well, first one hit ya with a crowbar, then the other one started kickin' ya when you were out."
},
{
"k": "1290",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Where are they now?"
},
{
"k": "1291",
"who": "WACHOWSKI",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Anyway, they both ran when I came yellin', hopped in a car and drove off. Didn't catch a plate number."
},
{
"k": "1292",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "The one I was talking to, I guess."
},
{
"k": "1293",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Either."
},
{
"k": "1294",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Either. Both."
},
{
"k": "1295",
"who": "WACHOWSKI",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Oh. Sorry, I... [looks over at Bigby] thought you were someone else. [beat] You sure you don't want me callin' an ambulance?"
},
{
"k": "1296",
"who": "WACHOWSKI",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "That doesn't look good."
},
{
"k": "1297",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "I think we'll be fine, Officer. Thank you for the help."
},
{
"k": "1298",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "He's a quick healer."
},
{
"k": "1299",
"who": "WACHOWSKI",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Actually… it looks like the bleeding may have stopped. Weird."
},
{
"k": "1300",
"who": "WACHOWSKI",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Yeah, that's gonna need stitches."
},
{
"k": "1301",
"who": "WACHOWSKI",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Nice to see you again. You stayin' outta trouble?"
},
{
"k": "1302",
"who": "WACHOWSKI",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Sneaky fuck."
},
