"k": "1303",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "I'm sorry. Have we met?"
},
{
"k": "1304",
"who": "WACHOWSKI",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "[yells after them] Next time it's gonna cost ya."
},
{
"k": "1305",
"who": "WACHOWSKI",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "[yells] I got my eye on you. [to himself] Sneaky fuck."
