"k": "1360",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "[pickup4] When I mentioned her being dead, he freaked out. I figured someone'd told him. How was I supposed to know?"
},
{
"k": "1361",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "[pickup4] I couldn't stop him, man."
},
{
"k": "1362",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "[pickup4] Look, I was just asking him about the girl. That's all."
},
{
"k": "1363",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "[pickup4] Fucker shot himself right in front of me."
},
{
"k": "1364",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "[pickup4] [looking guilty] Shit..."
},
{
"k": "1365",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "You're lookin' for the Woodsman, right?"
},
{
"k": "1366",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "I know where he is. My guy says he's holed up at the Trip Trap. We can go over there right now. The both of us.  My employer is looking to ask him a few questions, too."
},
{
"k": "1367",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "[pickup4]Nope. Can't say that I do. Come on. You're coming with me."
},
{
"k": "1368",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "Checking out the guy who was married to the girl. Seemed a good place to start. Tracking down...leads."
},
{
"k": "1369",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "[pickup4] You almost looked peaceful."
},
{
"k": "1370",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "[pickup4] With an open wound on the back of your head."
},
{
"k": "1371",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_alleychase",
"en": "[pickup4] Except you're lying in a dirty alley."
